WEBVTT

00:05:00.375 --> 00:05:07.375
(Applause)

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:14.167
Now, you might be thinking, why me?

00:05:15.042 --> 00:05:18.476
Well, I'm just one

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.351
of the thousands upon thousands

00:05:21.375 --> 00:05:24.458
of ordinary women
who are being preyed upon

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:32.684
in these mass-scale, horrific
online cultures, websites and threads